<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56409" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείω</span></b>  (A), once in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέω</span></b>  (v. infr., cf. <i><span class="en">
			A.D.
			<u>Adv.</u>
			143.11
		</span></i>), 
			Ep.
		 Desiderat. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖμαι, βῆ δ᾽ ἴμεναι
			κείων</span> he went <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to
				lie down</i>, went <i>to bed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.532
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.428
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθ᾽ ἴομεν κείοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.340
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείω</span> I <i>will lie</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.340
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κειέμεν οὕτω</span>
			<i>that they will lie</i> thus, <i><span class="en">
				8.315
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρσο κέων</span> get thee
				<i>to bed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.342
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later,
			simply, <i>sleep, rest</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				1009
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
